// Startup script of the demo game; the engine runs it at launch.
// It replaces the quake.rc inside demo/pak0.pak (loose files win over paks).
//
// No "stuffcmds" here: FTE runs the command-line +commands (e.g. +map room)
// itself once it has finished starting up. Running them from this script is
// too early and the +map is lost.

exec default.cfg	// default binds and settings of this game
exec autoexec.cfg	// optional, per-user tweaks (not shipped)
